@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Confirm current unfinished-task condition
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "WorkItemDetailPage / WorkItemDetailView" as page
  participant "UnfinishedTasksDialog" as dialog
  participant "IWorkItemService / WorkItemService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "WorkItemsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "CompleteStoryCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "StoryStatusTransition / StoryCompletionPolicy" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Set story status to Done (detail status control)
page -> client : WorkItemDetailView sends complete(CompleteStoryCommand: expected story version; no condition on first attempt); returns a promise
client -> access : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}/work-items/{storyId}/completion
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current session generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
  client --> page : The promise rejects with the 401 (nothing saved); navigation to sign-in destroys the page; the story is the return route
else Unexpected 403 (profile P: completing a story needs only an active session)
  access --> client : 403; Denied audit through IAuditEventWriter; nothing changed
  client -> client : sessionInterceptor refreshes capabilities (at most one refresh in flight)
  client --> page : The promise rejects; keep the saved status; completionStatus Forbidden: the prompt reports Forbidden, so any open dialog closes with Forbidden (focus returns to the status control)
  page --> actor : WorkItemDetailPage shows the "Your access changed" toast through TOAST_SERVICE, without Retry or reference ID
else Active session
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send CompleteStoryCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : Validate version and condition shape (path IDs are route-constrained GUIDs; a malformed one matches no route and returns 404)
  alt Malformed version or condition in the body
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read or changed
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : The promise rejects; completionStatus Settled; keep saved status; show the message linked to the status control, which keeps focus and reads it, without Try again or reference ID
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle CompleteStoryCommand
    handler -> db : BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync takes the workspace lock first (bounded wait)
    alt Lock wait times out
      db --> handler : Lock timeout; nothing changed
      handler --> ctrl : 503 with Retry-After
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unavailable)
      client --> page : The promise rejects; keep saved status; completionStatus Failed with the reference ID; without a dialog the status control shows it with Try again
      opt Confirmation dialog open
        page -> dialog : WorkItemDetailPage sets the prompt to failed with the reference ID; the change stays pending; Mark story Done retries the same request; Keep sends nothing
      end
    else Lock held
      handler -> db : LoadStoryPlacementsAsync: status, version, live placements, task revision and unfinished count (one aggregate over child tasks)
      db --> handler : Current story and completion condition
      alt Workspace or story not found
        handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
        ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
        client --> page : The promise rejects; completionStatus Settled closes any dialog; WorkItemDetailView rereads its workItemResource once
        alt The read's 404 carries category item-not-found
          page --> actor : The item's not-found state, offering the project's work and the project list; the header still shows the project; focus moves to its heading
        else The read's 404 carries category workspace-not-found
          page --> actor : The project's not-found presentation (Back to projects; no Try again or reference ID); the view emits notFound and WorkItemDetailPage calls the layout's refresh(), so the header keeps only the breadcrumb
        end
      else Not a story
        handler --> ctrl : 400 only stories take a completion; nothing changed
        ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
        client --> page : The promise rejects; completionStatus Settled; keep saved status; show the message linked to the status control, which keeps focus and reads it, without Try again or reference ID
      else Stale story version
        handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version; nothing changed
        ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (stale version)
        client --> page : The promise rejects; completionStatus Settled closes any dialog; WorkItemDetailView reloads its workItemResource once to show the latest story
      else Unfinished tasks; condition absent or no longer current
        handler -> entity : L2-021 StoryStatusTransition applies StoryCompletionPolicy: compare sent condition with current count and task revision
        entity --> handler : Confirmation required; nothing changed
        handler --> ctrl : 409 unfinished-tasks with count and StoryCompletionCondition; nothing changed
        ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unfinished-tasks)
        client --> page : The promise rejects with the condition; WorkItemDetailView keeps the change pending; completionStatus ConfirmationRequired with the story's key, title, saved status and condition
        page -> dialog : WorkItemDetailPage opens it with the prompt built from that status and focuses Keep in progress; if already open, it shows server-count, whose alert announces the new count without moving focus
        alt Mark story Done
          dialog --> page : confirmed(condition); WorkItemDetailPage passes it through completionDecision; the prompt shows saving
          page -> client : WorkItemDetailView resubmits complete(CompleteStoryCommand) with the returned condition
          note right of client : Re-enters this flow; a changed count returns a new 409 (server-count)
        else Keep in progress, or Escape
          dialog --> page : kept; WorkItemDetailPage passes it through completionDecision
          page -> page : WorkItemDetailView sends no request; status unchanged; completionStatus Settled; the prompt reports Settled, so the dialog closes with Settled; focus returns to the status control
        else A navigation closes the dialog with no result (another item's link, or Back or Forward)
          page -> page : WorkItemDetailPage relays kept through completionDecision, as if Keep in progress were chosen; WorkItemDetailView drops its pending completion and sends no request
        end
      else No unfinished tasks, or condition still current
        handler -> entity : L2-021 StoryStatusTransition: Done permitted; set status, move every live placement, increment the active sprint's version when the story is a member; child task statuses unchanged
        entity --> handler : Story Done on every live placement
        handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 AddAuditEvent registers the success audit; SaveChangesAsync checks tracked versions and commits story, placements, sprint version and audit
        alt Commit fails
          db --> handler : Roll back business state and success audit
          handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
          ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
          client --> page : The promise rejects; status unchanged; completionStatus Failed with the reference ID; without a dialog the status control shows it with Try again
          opt Confirmation dialog open
            page -> dialog : WorkItemDetailPage sets the prompt to failed with the reference ID; the change stays pending; Mark story Done retries the same request; Keep sends nothing
          end
        else Commit succeeds
          db --> handler : New story version
          handler --> ctrl : Completed story
          ctrl --> client : 200 with status and version
          client --> page : The promise resolves; completionStatus Settled closes any dialog; WorkItemDetailView reloads its workItemResource
          page --> actor : Announce "Story marked Done"; open-task count unchanged
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
note over page, client
No response (timeout or network failure) is an uncertain outcome: the story
may or may not be Done, so the view never claims nothing changed and resends
nothing. WorkItemDetailView reloads its workItemResource once; when the read
settles it reports completionStatus Settled, which closes any open dialog, and
announces the persisted status. If that read fails too, the detail shows its
load error with Try again.
end note
note over ctrl, db
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
